OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuees' fear as no return date
OL,4,Ais set for flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople made homeless after being
OL,7,Fordered to leave their structurally
OL,8,Funsafe flats in east London have told
OL,9,Fthe BBC of the devastating effect this
OL,10,Fis having on them.
OL,12,FMore than 330 households and several
OL,13,Fbusinesses in the new Caxton Works
OL,14,Fdevelopment were told to leave without
OL,15,Fnotice after the blocks were found to
OL,16,Fbe in danger of collapse.
OL,18,FSome say they are paying for hotels as
OL,19,Fwell as mortgages, with no financial
OL,20,Fhelp or return date, with one
OL,21,Fleaseholder saying "this could destroy
OL,22,Fmy life".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
