OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuees' fear as no return date
OL,4,Ais set for flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe management firm said the
OL,7,Fdevelopment - also known as Royal
OL,8,FGateway - was evacuated after expert
OL,9,Fadvice and to "preserve life" and it
OL,10,Fwas trying to identify those
OL,11,Fresponsible and fix the buildings.
